# "When this creature enters, draw a card": the trigger is independent of Strix once it is on the stack (CR 113.7a). Strix
# is cast on turn three; Bot2, holding Lightning Bolt and an untapped Mountain, kills it in response to the trigger, and
# Bot1 still draws. Strix dying draws nothing more.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Baleful Strix
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
